< R 2 CARD Hercules "Graphics Card" HGC-1 EXC ? 2 1 "Shelf A1" A "" "" ""
< R 3 CPU Intel 8088 X1 "" ? 3 1 "Shelf A1" A "" "" ""
< R 1 SYS IBM 5150 0012345 GD ? 1 2 "Box B2" A 19840312 450.00 1200.50
< R 4 DRV Seagate ST-225 X1 "" ? 1 3 "Bin C3" D "" "" ""
